{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q25", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主个性及特色情况如何？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱丁卯、月柱癸丑、日柱甲子、时柱丁卯。日主甲木生于丑月，土旺木囚，但得子水正印生扶，时支卯木为根，年时两透丁火伤官。甲木有根有印，性格上外柔内刚，但伤官透出，主聪明外露、风流多情。月柱癸丑，正印坐财库，有懒惰倾向，但印星护身，为人可靠。子卯相刑，主风流好色，女人缘佳。综合来看，符合“可靠，懒惰，不怕事，风流，女人缘好”的描述。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q25", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 2613, "response_id": "ddeeb93b-b256-442b-80cc-10fb601cb22f", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 154, "total_tokens": 390, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q26", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的性格和出生如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子。日主壬水生于申月，金旺水相，得月令生扶，又时柱壬子水强根，身旺。年柱癸丑，劫财坐正官，月柱庚申偏印生身，时柱壬子比肩帮身。整体水势强旺，金水相生，性格上聪明灵活，足智多谋（水主智），且月柱庚申为偏印，主有谋略和机变。年柱癸丑，劫财透干，但丑为财库，且月令申金为偏印生身，年支丑土为官星之库，暗示家庭背景不错，有祖荫或财富积累。但日主壬水过旺，水多则固执，不易变通。综合看，符合“足智多谋，为人仗义（水旺主仁，但劫财透干有义气），但比较固执（水多主顽固），出生在有钱家庭（年柱官库且月令生身有力）”。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q26", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5651, "response_id": "1e5dc2c0-45b5-403f-a4b8-4b5087286a77", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 262, "completion_tokens": 251, "total_tokens": 513, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 262}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主喜欢的居家装修风格是？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主壬水生于申月，金水旺盛，身强。命局中水旺，喜用神为火、土、木。水旺之人通常喜欢流动、变化，但身强水旺也可能导致内心追求平衡与宁静。时柱壬子，水势更旺，性格上可能偏于内向、冷静，但月柱庚申金生水，有较强的自我意识和审美追求。\n\n从五行喜忌来看，命主喜火（温暖、光明）、土（稳定、厚重）、木（生长、自然）。装修风格上，火对应明亮、热情，土对应稳重、古典，木对应自然、简约。选项中：\n\n- A. 炫酷高科技（偏金水，不合喜用）\n- B. 欧式高贵典雅（偏金，且古灵精怪摆设可能带水木，但整体偏金）\n- C. 中式复古，古董和风水物品（土、木元素多，符合喜用，且风水物品与命理相关）\n- D. 环保极简（木元素，但“极简”可能偏水，且不喜欢摆设与命主水旺喜动不太符）\n\n综合来看，C选项最符合命主喜用神（土、木），且风水物品与命理契合，因此选择C。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5071, "response_id": "abbfdf6d-470b-41d0-a409-e073862fca1c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 240, "completion_tokens": 285, "total_tokens": 525, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 240}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "在丙辰大限（43–52），命主在哪一年出国创业？和什么领域相关？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子，日主壬水生于申月得令，地支申子辰三合水局，身强。喜用神为火土（财官），忌金水。\n\n丙辰大限（43-52岁，即2016-2025年），大运天干丙火为偏财，地支辰土为七杀，财杀相生，利于求财创业，但辰土为水库，与原局辰子半合水，水势仍旺，需流年火土有力方能成事。\n\n分析各选项流年：\n- 2015乙未年：未土为燥土，但乙木伤官生财，且未土与丑冲，冲开财库，但此年尚在乙卯大限（33-42岁）末，非丙辰大限，故排除。\n- 2017丁酉年：丁火正财，但酉金生水，金水旺，财星虚浮，且酉辰合化金，增强忌神，不利创业。\n- 2018戊戌年：戊土七杀，戌土燥土，火库，且戌与辰冲，冲动日支夫妻宫（也代表事业根基），冲则动，主变动、出国。戊土七杀制水，戌中藏丁火正财，财杀相生，且大运丙火偏财透出，流年戊土七杀，财生杀，杀旺有制，主开创事业。戌为火库，与饮食（火）或房地产（土）相关，但戌为火库，更偏向餐饮或火属性行业。\n- 2019己亥年：己土正官，但亥水为忌神，水旺冲巳（无巳），且亥子丑会水局，水势泛滥，不利。\n\n综合判断，2018戊戌年，大运丙辰，流年戊戌，辰戌冲，冲动事业宫，且财杀有力，最符合出国创业之象。戌土为火库，与饮食（烹饪、火）相关，且戊土为城墙土，也可指房地产，但戌中丁火为食神（代表饮食），且火土燥热，更贴近饮食领域。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 7350, "response_id": "f0bd55a3-e6f6-4758-a912-2cf955f5a35d", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 505, "total_tokens": 746, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepse