{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子。日主壬水生于申月得令，地支申子辰三合水局，天干两壬一癸，水势极旺，身强无疑。喜用神为火土（财官），忌神为金水。\n\n2021年为辛丑年。流年天干辛金为正印（忌神），地支丑土为正官（喜神但被水局所困）。大运方面，命主生于1973年，2021年虚岁49，行至丙辰大运（约40-50岁）。丙火为偏财（喜神），辰土为七杀（喜神），但辰与命局子、申再合水局，加重水势，财星丙火被旺水克制，财星受损。\n\n流年辛丑，辛金生水，丑土虽为官星，但丑与命局子水相合（子丑合土，但水旺则合而不化，反助水势），且丑为湿土，不能制水，反而晦火。大运丙火财星被旺水冲克，流年又无火土强根救助，主破财、投资失利、事业受阻。\n\n2021年正值疫情后期，命主为商人（财星为用），水旺财弱，生意资金链断裂，难以周转，最终倒闭。选项A符合此象。其他选项：B为意外伤害（需看七杀冲克，但此局水旺无制，非明显血光），C为母亲（正印为忌，但流年辛金正印透出，母亲有灾，但题目更侧重生意，且A更贴合财星受损），D为顺利则完全相反。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5447, "response_id": "88d98252-8460-48eb-8218-70a754382171", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 395, "total_tokens": 636, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子，日主壬水生于申月得令，又得时柱壬子强根，身旺无疑。八字水势泛滥，喜火土来制衡，但原局火弱土虚，仅年支丑土为湿土，难以制水。\n\n2024年为甲辰年，流年天干甲木食神透出，地支辰土为七杀。甲木食神泄身，但原局水旺木浮，食神无力；辰土七杀虽能制水，但辰为水库，反而助水势，且与日支辰伏吟，加重水患。水过旺则主肾、膀胱、血液、骨骼（水主骨）方面问题。\n\n流年甲木食神代表饮食、口腹之欲，但木弱被水漂，显示饮食失控，易肥胖（水多主湿，湿气重则胖）。原局无火，水寒木凋，身体阳气不足，代谢缓慢，更易堆积脂肪。时柱壬子水势最旺，子为刃，主意外或突发问题，但流年辰土与子水无直接冲刑，车祸骨折可能性较低。\n\n综合判断，命主2024年健康问题主要源于水旺湿重，饮食不节，导致肥胖，而非外伤或严重疾病。选项A最符合命理特征。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5494, "response_id": "50d7b6a5-1eb6-4afa-95bc-70ff13f249d8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 238, "completion_tokens": 316, "total_tokens": 554, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 110}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", "domain": "family", "question": "命主原生家庭父母亲状况？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，年柱为戊辰，月柱为甲寅，日柱为庚子，时柱为甲申。日主庚金生于寅月，木旺金囚，月干甲木偏财透出，年干戊土偏印生身，但地支寅木与申金相冲，时支申金为日主之根，但被月支寅木冲克，根基不稳。\n\n原生家庭看年柱与月柱。年柱戊辰，戊土偏印为母星，辰土为印库，但辰中藏乙木正财，与月柱甲木偏财相合，暗示父母关系有复杂互动。月柱甲寅，甲木为偏财（父星），坐禄于寅，父星强旺，但月支寅木与年支辰土无直接作用，却与时支申金相冲，形成“寅申冲”，此为驿马冲，主变动、分离。\n\n日柱庚子，庚金日主坐下子水伤官，伤官克官，女命伤官旺则不利婚姻，但此指命主自身婚姻，对父母而言，月柱甲木偏财为父，年干戊土偏印为母，甲木克戊土（偏财克偏印），即父星克母星，且甲木坐寅木强根，戊土坐辰土有根，但木旺土虚，父强母弱。时柱甲申，甲木再次透出，与月柱甲木并见，父星重叠，且申金为庚金之根，与寅木冲，加剧家庭动荡。\n\n综合判断，父母星相克明显，且月支与时支冲，家庭宫位不稳，离异可能性高。年柱为父母宫，戊辰土印星为母，但被月柱甲木克制，母星受制，可能母亲在家庭中地位较弱或离开；时柱申金为日主之根，也代表命主自身，申金冲寅木（父星），暗示命主与父亲关系有冲突或分离。因父星强旺且克母，母星受制，离异后更可能跟随父亲（父星有力）。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6275, "response_id": "06cd4a65-c26f-4252-84a6-6bfc77bf2419", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 223, "completion_tokens": 485, "total_tokens": 708, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 223}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q32", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主大学时期读什么科系？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为庚金，生于寅月（木旺），年柱戊辰（土生金），月柱甲寅（木旺克土），日柱庚子（金生水），时柱甲申（木金相战）。整体来看，命局中木（财星）较旺，金（日主）有土生但受木克，需看五行平衡与十神组合。\n\n大学时期（约18-22岁）对应大运，命主出生于1988年，起运较早（因年柱戊辰，阳年女命逆排大运）。月柱甲寅，逆排大运为癸丑、壬子、辛亥、庚戌等。大学阶段约在2006-2010年，正值壬子大运（水旺），水为食伤，主才华、艺术、表达。食伤旺时，人倾向于选择艺术、创意、表达类科系。\n\n再看命局中，月柱甲寅为偏财，时柱甲申亦为偏财，财星旺但无正官（官星为火，命局中无明火），而食伤（水）透出在日支子水，且大运壬子水旺，食伤生财，但食伤也主艺术、技艺。结合选项，音乐（A）和美术（C）均属艺术类，但食伤水更偏向流动、声音、表演（音乐），而美术偏静、土金性质。命局中金生水，水为食伤，音乐更符合水之灵动特性。\n\n金融（B）属金，但命局金弱受克，且大运水旺，不倾向金融。理工（D）属金或火，但命局缺火，且食伤旺时更重感性而非理性。\n\n综合判断，食伤旺且水主导，最可能选择音乐。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q32", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6309, "response_id": "eb59787a-c3f1-44e3-af16-449af167002f", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 207, "completion_tokens": 411, "total_tokens": 618, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 79}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
